{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"在Refresh_Token有效期内，通过该接口刷新Access_Token，会同时获得新的AccessToken及RefreshToken并更新效期时间，原Token失效。Refresh_Token、Access_Token、auth_code失效后，只能重新申请授权获取。建议调用Token相关接口时避免并发请求。关键配合接口有「获取Access Token」。\",\"id\":\"oauth2.refresh_token.refresh\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/oauth2/refresh_token/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710506097679\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"oauth2.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"/open_api/oauth2/access_token/\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access Token才能进行刷新操作\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710506097679\",\"title\":\"刷新Refresh Token\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-p8UkwQcp\">Refresh_Token在有效期内，可以通过接口刷新Access_Token，刷新会同时获得新的AccessToken及RefreshToken并更新效期时间（不会影响已有授权关系），同时原Token也会失效，再次刷新需要使用本次刷新获取的新的RefreshToken。</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PgUQP%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-bcvNVBmb%5C%22%3ERefresh_Token%E3%80%81Access_Token%E3%80%81auth_code%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E5%9C%A8%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8Token%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E6%97%B6%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14