>MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-KWD8lBES\" id=\"h346b9f0-KWD8lBES\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-y8ZVt54j\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1RDh4PcU\" id=\"h346b9f0-1RDh4PcU\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KbFPsxXa\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-fJU6FkfZ\" id=\"h346b9f0-fJU6FkfZ\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eXkWNHFA\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">开发者申请的应用APP_ID，可通过【</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/ad_list\" target=\"_blank\">应用管理</a><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">】界面查看</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">appid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">secret</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-djnacozB\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">开发者应用的私钥Secret，可通过【</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/ad_list\" target=\"_blank\">应用管理</a><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">】界面编辑应用查看</span></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-kGL5CHY3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YKVKe5FH\">传入<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">app_id与secret需对应，及同一应用下信息</span></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">refresh_token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2EQcKdDp\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">刷新token，从「</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">获取Access Token</span></a>」<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">和「</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710506097679\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">刷新Access Token</span></a>」<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">的返回结果中得到，刷新后会过期，请及时保存最新的token</span></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-7916Qlej\" id=\"h346b9f0-7916Qlej\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Foauth2%2Frefresh_token%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20POST%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH)%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Content-Type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22application%2Fjson%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.post(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders%2C%20json%3Dargs)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn